  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "聞いたことない曲だけど、\r\n最近の歌……ではないよな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん！　マザーグースだよ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "マザーグース……って童謡だったか",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そうそう！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "今日の授業でちょっと話が出たんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "昔よく歌ってたから、懐かしいなーって！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ちっちゃい頃歌ってた曲って、結構覚えてるんだよね\r\nどんどん思い出すから、楽しくなってきちゃって！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "──あっ！\r\nもしかして、うるさかった……？　ごめん！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいや、全然\r\n聞いたことない曲だったから、気になってさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そっか、よかった……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さっき歌ってた曲、歌詞ってあるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あるよ！　これ、言葉遊びの歌でね──",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "『ジャックが建てた家』\r\n『ジャックが建てた家に転がってた麦芽』",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "『ジャックが建てた家に転がってた麦芽を食べたねずみ』",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "──って、どんどん説明が増えていくの！\r\nメロディーも、歌の頭にどんどん増えるんだよー",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へえ……！\r\n曲の形態が自由なのってすごいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "Ａメロ、Ｂメロ、サビっていかないの面白いよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "すっごく短いのとかもあるし\r\n昔の歌なんだなーって思う！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ちっちゃい頃は、歌うの楽しい！　ばっかりで\r\n曲の構成なんて気にしてなかったけど……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小さい頃はそうだよなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "しかし、マザーグースって面白いんだな",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "他によく歌っていた\r\n曲ってあるのか？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "めぐるのお気に入り\r\nの曲ってあるのか？",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "有名な曲も\r\nあるのか？",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010170,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "いっぱいあるよー！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "薔薇は赤いすみれは青い……って\r\nそのまんまだよー！　な歌とか",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ウサギの鼻にハエが止まって追い払う歌とか……！\r\nこっちは手遊び歌で、友達と一緒に振りをやるんだ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "お母さんにせがんで、色々歌ってもらったなー",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小さい頃のめぐるも歌うことと動くことが好きだったんだな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010210,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん！\r\n歌うのも動くのもずっと大好き！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010220,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "テレビの前でずっと真似してたし、\r\n友達に『教えてー』って言ってもらうこともあって！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010230,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "まぁ、『めぐるちゃんのバッとかグッってよくわかんない』\r\nって、この頃から言われてたんだけどね……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010240,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "一緒に歌って、踊る……のとはちょっと違うけど……\r\nみんながひとつになると、あったかい気持ちになる！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうなのか……！\r\nめぐるはアイドルになるべくしてなったって感じだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010250,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへっ、だったら嬉しいなー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010250"
  },
