    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010280,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "──って、これは大きくなってから\r\nすっごく好きになったんだけどね",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010290,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……というか、きらきら星もマザーグースなんだな\r\n知らなかったよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010300,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そうだよー！　たぶん、そうだって知らないだけで\r\n結構マザーグースの曲聞いたことあると思う",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301101/2003011010300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011010310,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサーにも、好きになってもらえたら嬉しいなー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
